# ── macOS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store

# ── Xcode: per-user state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Window positions, breakpoints, scheme ordering. Changes on every launch and
# means nothing to anyone else.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything under Builds/<exporter>/build/ is generated by Xcode. The .jucer
# and the generated .xcodeproj stay tracked, so a clone still builds.
**/Builds/*/build/
DerivedData/
*.o
*.d

# ── Spikes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Compiled throwaway binaries; the sources and notes are tracked.
spikes/*
!spikes/*.cpp
!spikes/*.md
